  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-dentist-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "53ca733e0845379ae96896ac0f99990be42afd4ed0224408dbfbf0e6b8abff74",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7cd185ed5aefc1a8ca4ea2d197fbfcc0165a4ab8be75ed36f5052b5ac2b9939b",
      "text": "Wukong Visits\nthe Dentist",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bf4d4cd3188b593faf1e10f1f82ca6239c2cef027500631e90f3190078810a4d",
      "text": "Today Wukong\nvisits the dentist.\nSandy comes too.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cb8a08c24d8e6c278ca1c73b9a252b634dc2bd935e2e9717665b8ccf2b9a0198",
      "text": "Pigsy is in the waiting room.\n“Hi, Wukong!”\nWukong sees a big chair.\n“Wow!”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bb544161cf4ea2e300eba2377c28eaf7300429c60cbb2fed9c70d1b33130831b",
      "text": "Bzzz, bzzz!\n“Is that a big bee?”\nWukong holds Sandy’s hand.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "712716fefaab34d8f6b628b98a73d212772672c49246c3550c2988a9054100da",
      "text": "The dentist smiles.\nLittle bears are on her shirt.\n“Hello, Wukong!\nLet’s look first.”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "99edf1708686bc69f245d15621deca7d0f1150a7fd6896f8cbd679079eedcb6f",
      "text": "She shows a little mirror.\n“This helps me look\nat your teeth.”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1416a974028e9a24da771aa62278540b79c78f7d34e3a927777dba04d8c9eb93",
      "text": "“If you want to stop,\nraise your hand.\nThen I will stop.”\nWukong nods.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6008287897aec394a1ae43d9898074dc6cb6fbf97469fb2fa9ea9900c3af5378",
      "text": "Wukong climbs into the chair.\n“Ready?” asks the dentist.\nUp, up, up it goes!\n“Like a little cloud!”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1e8c5595e7130d08e8cac77293d5b098bf68df998900321b23742d9233d9b48d",
      "text": "“Open wide,” says the dentist.\n“Ahhh!”\nShe looks at each tooth.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9d6d03f1a5da227d1c9cab3d8adfa24395eb386fabfabd80e1ed3d0948f13c53",
      "text": "Bzzz!\nWukong feels scared.\nHe raises his hand.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "328d07704c66fd02ad0f2b009df9da83b807679fb75d3f5c8e9cb361371cc8dd",
      "text": "The dentist stops.\n“Okay. We can stop.”\nSandy holds his hand.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9f4a2e3ce5ba82a0b2dcd3241a8d1e0daa7ae565ec5767b5ed5f5b1391fadde4",
      "text": "Wukong asks,\n“What makes the bzzz?”\n“My little brush,” she says.\n“It tickles.”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5ea1bb62608adfdf4044566fecba22658b64d1ec6d8198a5093b49daf228e381",
      "text": "“Now I am ready,”\nsays Wukong.\nHe opens wide again.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae8e0c5e274e8db2e38e309e5d9f8b7c13f0139be0e9a98eb16f34c1cb7abc17",
      "text": "Bzzz, bzzz.\nTickle, tickle!\n“All done!” says the dentist.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c9399c26be4d9ff4af2df98aae0558c4b47443d67e175fb75f7dd439f61b8376",
      "text": "Wukong smiles in the mirror.\n“I told you what I needed!”\nAs he leaves, the dentist\ngives him a little toothbrush.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a79c6c92a2b872858c9a830ead065f6559da44dbdc71ba731989ddf3312e1857",
      "text": "At home, Pigsy’s toys line up.\n“Open wide!” says Wukong.\n“If you want to stop,\nraise your paw!”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
